      en: ["Founded in 1776 during the Spanish colonial period.", "Located on the Masacre River, which marks the border with Haiti.", "Economic hub due to the bi-national market held on Mondays and Fridays.", "Capital of the Dajabón province in the northwest region.", "Major producer of rice and tobacco for national consumption and export.", "Strategic military location for border control and security."],
