      en: ["El Valle is a primary site for the mining of world-famous Dominican amber.", "The town is located on the southeastern edge of Los Haitises National Park.", "Cocoa produced in El Valle is highly rated for its organic quality and flavor.", "The municipality was officially established in the year 1982.", "The Salto de Yanigua waterfall is a nearby landmark famous for its natural beauty.", "The valley receives high annual rainfall, contributing to its lush tropical landscape."],
